    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "I suppose my interest begins as a former member of Congress, first and foremost, and then a former Republican member of Congress. I believe it's clear, and I think the trial record makes it clear, and I think there's bipartisan agreement that makes it clear. that Donald Trump engaged in insurrection against the Constitution. As a former congressman, that's a big deal because it's kind of our constitutional role to effectuate the peaceful transfer of power and what Trump did was an attempt to stop that. As a Republican, and this is in Amicus brief by about 12 to 14 of us, Republicans, we felt it was important to get on the record that this is not at all partisan.",
