      },
      {
        "text": "States currently lack clear precedent or interpretation of Section 3 of the 14th Amendment.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "There exists a shared expectation that the Supreme Court should resolve constitutional ambiguities.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Elected officials' eligibility to run for office depends on their past conduct related to insurrection.",
