  {
    "episode_id": 95367,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/5/95367.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 21,
    "turn_text": "Oh, absolutely. And Jennifer, again, it's been fascinating. I very publicly the past five or six years ever since I publicly came out about against Trump. I have very publicly, I'm national TV humbling, repeatedly apologized for everything I did that led to Donald Trump. And the Tea Party was certainly part of that. I've said now so many times that two things led to Trump, a Republican establishment that ignored the base of the party. people like Mitt Romney and the rest. And then people like me, Joe Walsh, the Tea Party right-wing aspect of the party, we inflamed the base, got them all riled up and worked up. So by the time Donald Trump came along in 2016, we had primed them for Trump. Absolutely, I've apologized for that and tried to explain that publicly for a good long time.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
