    "turn_text": "Again, I don't know that they'd listen to one word I'd say, but if I had them alone for a few minutes, I would just tell them that this road they're going down. This MAGA authoritarian, embracing, nationalistic road is shrinking the party dramatically. And if you stay on this road, Matt Gaetz and Marjorie, if the party stays on this road, the party is going to die as a national political party because this intolerant authoritarian thing they've got going now is an absolute turnoff to most Americans, certainly young Americans and Americans of color. So if they care about the party, they have to They have to move away from this.",
